{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"header","type":"text","x":0,"y":-420,"width":4650,"height":260,"color":"4","text":"# 导数的应用\n\n**连续阅读：** [[01_Math/01_calculus/02_导数的应用|从局部近似到整体控制与动态方程]]　·　**完整课堂记录：** [[01_Math/01_calculus/02_Applications_of_Differentiation|MIT 18.01SC Unit 2]]\n\n从上方的局部近似、形状与优化进入；中层展示相关变化率、Newton 法、中值定理及向积分的桥；下层把导数写成动态方程。箭头说明依赖或用途；颜色只区分图中角色，不表示掌握程度。"},
		{"id":"group-approx","type":"group","x":-100,"y":0,"width":1500,"height":1080,"label":"A｜局部近似与误差"},
		{"id":"derivative","type":"text","x":0,"y":100,"width":360,"height":170,"color":"3","text":"## [[导数]]\n\n差商极限给局部线性响应，是整张图的共同输入。"},
		{"id":"linear","type":"text","x":500,"y":100,"width":360,"height":190,"color":"4","text":"## [[线性近似]]\n\n切线匹配函数值与一阶导数；余项相对位移趋零。"},
		{"id":"error","type":"text","x":1000,"y":100,"width":300,"height":190,"color":"3","text":"## [[绝对误差与相对误差]]\n\n绝对量保留单位；相对量跨尺度但在零附近失效。"},
		{"id":"quadratic","type":"text","x":0,"y":440,"width":360,"height":190,"color":"4","text":"## [[二次近似]]\n\n再匹配二阶导数，把基点处曲率纳入局部模型。"},
		{"id":"taylor-poly","type":"text","x":500,"y":440,"width":360,"height":190,"color":"4","text":"## [[Taylor多项式]]\n\n用 $1/k!$ 配置系数，在中心逐阶匹配导数。"},
		{"id":"taylor-rem","type":"text","x":1000,"y":440,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"5","text":"## [[Taylor余项]]\n\n区间上的高阶导数界把“近似”变成可核验的误差证书。"},
		{"id":"higher-derivative","type":"text","x":0,"y":750,"width":320,"height":180,"color":"3","text":"## [[高阶导数]]\n\n逐阶求导提供 Taylor 系数与余项所需的变化率层次。"},
		{"id":"approx-bridge","type":"text","x":400,"y":790,"width":900,"height":150,"color":"2","text":"局部模型回答“附近大约是多少”；误差对象回答“这个大约能信到什么程度”。"},
		{"id":"group-shape","type":"group","x":1575,"y":0,"width":1500,"height":1080,"label":"B｜从导数读函数形状"},
		{"id":"asymptote","type":"text","x":1675,"y":100,"width":350,"height":180,"color":"4","text":"## [[渐近线]]\n\n先由极限识别有限边界与无穷远行为。"},
		{"id":"critical","type":"text","x":2160,"y":100,"width":350,"height":180,"color":"4","text":"## [[临界点]]\n\n定义域内点的导数为零或不存在；端点另列，候选仍需分类。"},
		{"id":"monotonic","type":"text","x":2645,"y":100,"width":330,"height":200,"color":"5","text":"## [[导数单调性判据]]\n\n区间上 $f'$ 的符号决定函数增减，而非一个点的斜率。"},
		{"id":"concavity","type":"text","x":1675,"y":440,"width":350,"height":200,"color":"4","text":"## [[凹凸性]]\n\n图像位于弦下方为凸，上方为凹；定义不要求可导。"},
		{"id":"inflection","type":"text","x":2160,"y":440,"width":350,"height":200,"color":"1","text":"## [[拐点]]\n\n必须发生凹凸改变；$f''=0$ 只给候选。"},
		{"id":"sketch","type":"text","x":2645,"y":440,"width":330,"height":230,"color":"6","text":"## [[曲线描绘]]\n\n定义域 → 极限与渐近线 → 临界点 → 两张符号表 → 一致性检查。"},
		{"id":"convex-criterion","type":"text","x":1675,"y":750,"width":350,"height":230,"color":"5","text":"## [[导数判凹凸]]\n\n在可导开区间上，凸性等价于导数非减；二阶导数存在时可查其全区间符号。"},
		{"id":"shape-bridge","type":"text","x":2160,"y":790,"width":815,"height":150,"color":"2","text":"先切开定义域，再在每个连通区间拼接局部信息；零导数和零二阶导数都不能单独完成分类。"},
		{"id":"group-opt","type":"group","x":3250,"y":0,"width":1500,"height":1080,"label":"C｜极值、候选与全局证明"},
		{"id":"extrema","type":"text","x":3350,"y":90,"width":330,"height":180,"color":"4","text":"## [[局部极值与绝对极值]]\n\n邻域比较与全域比较是两种问题；点和值也要分开。"},
		{"id":"evt","type":"text","x":3785,"y":90,"width":330,"height":180,"color":"3","text":"## [[极值定理]]\n\n连续函数在非空紧集上确实取得最大与最小。"},
		{"id":"foc","type":"text","x":4220,"y":90,"width":330,"height":200,"color":"3","text":"## [[无约束一阶条件]]\n\n光滑内点极值必须驻定；边界、不可导点和充分性仍未处理。"},
		{"id":"closed","type":"text","x":3350,"y":380,"width":330,"height":210,"color":"6","text":"## [[闭区间极值法]]\n\n比较两端点与全部内部临界值，寻找绝对极值。"},
		{"id":"first-test","type":"text","x":3785,"y":380,"width":330,"height":200,"color":"6","text":"## [[一阶导数检验]]\n\n中心连续，两侧导数严格正变负给局部最大；负变正给局部最小。"},
		{"id":"second-test","type":"text","x":4220,"y":380,"width":330,"height":210,"color":"5","text":"## [[二阶导数检验]]\n\n驻点处非零曲率可分类；零曲率没有结论。"},
		{"id":"constraint-opt","type":"text","x":3480,"y":720,"width":410,"height":220,"color":"6","text":"## [[单变量约束优化]]\n\n先写目标、约束与可行域；消元后再求候选并查边界。"},
		{"id":"convex-global","type":"text","x":4080,"y":720,"width":410,"height":220,"color":"3","text":"## [[凸优化全局性]]\n\n凸可行域上的凹目标可把局部最大升级为全局最大。"},
		{"id":"group-rate-root","type":"group","x":-100,"y":1250,"width":1500,"height":1050,"label":"D｜速率联系与切线求根"},
		{"id":"related-rates","type":"text","x":0,"y":1360,"width":370,"height":210,"color":"6","text":"## [[相关变化率]]\n\n先写全过程恒等式，对共同时间求导，再代指定时刻。"},
		{"id":"newton","type":"text","x":500,"y":1360,"width":370,"height":200,"color":"3","text":"## [[Newton迭代]]\n\n用当前切线的零点生成下一次根近似。"},
		{"id":"newton-local","type":"text","x":1000,"y":1360,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"5","text":"## [[Newton局部收敛]]\n\n足够接近光滑简单根时，下一误差受当前误差平方控制。"},
		{"id":"newton-fail","type":"text","x":260,"y":1760,"width":370,"height":220,"color":"1","text":"## [[Newton失效边界]]\n\n坏初值、小导数、周期、错误吸引域和越界都可能失败。"},
		{"id":"hybrid","type":"text","x":780,"y":1760,"width":370,"height":220,"color":"3","text":"## [[混合求根]]\n\n保留异号括区间，只把安全 Newton 步当加速候选。"},
		{"id":"group-mvt","type":"group","x":1575,"y":1250,"width":1500,"height":1050,"label":"E｜从局部斜率到整体结论"},
		{"id":"rolle","type":"text","x":1675,"y":1360,"width":350,"height":210,"color":"5","text":"## [[罗尔定理]]\n\n端点等高时，连续可导曲线至少有一条内部水平切线。"},
		{"id":"mvt","type":"text","x":2160,"y":1360,"width":350,"height":220,"color":"5","text":"## [[拉格朗日中值定理]]\n\n某个内部瞬时斜率精确等于端点平均斜率。"},
		{"id":"increment","type":"text","x":2645,"y":1360,"width":330,"height":220,"color":"5","text":"## [[导数界控制函数差]]\n\n区间导数上下界给端点差的有限增量界。"},
		{"id":"ineq","type":"text","x":1900,"y":1780,"width":400,"height":210,"color":"6","text":"## [[导数法证明不等式]]\n\n构造差函数、锚定等号点，再以导数符号控制整段。"},
		{"id":"mvt-note","type":"text","x":2440,"y":1780,"width":430,"height":210,"color":"2","text":"MVT 是精确存在式但中间点未知；线性近似使用已知基点却只给局部近似。"},
		{"id":"group-bridge","type":"group","x":3250,"y":1250,"width":1500,"height":1050,"label":"F｜从导数向积分搭桥"},
		{"id":"differential","type":"text","x":3350,"y":1360,"width":350,"height":210,"color":"4","text":"## [[微分]]\n\n$dy=f'(x)dx$ 是一阶线性变化，不等于真实有限变化 $\\Delta y$。"},
		{"id":"antiderivative","type":"text","x":3840,"y":1360,"width":350,"height":200,"color":"4","text":"## [[原函数]]\n\n在一个区间上满足 $F'=f$；不定积分表示整族原函数。"},
		{"id":"constant","type":"text","x":4330,"y":1360,"width":320,"height":220,"color":"5","text":"## [[原函数相差常数]]\n\n同一连通区间上的自由度只剩一个加法常数。"},
		{"id":"substitution","type":"text","x":3740,"y":1790,"width":420,"height":210,"color":"3","text":"## [[换元积分]]\n\n把链式法则反向识别，内层函数与对应微分必须一起替换。"},
		{"id":"bridge-note","type":"text","x":4250,"y":1790,"width":400,"height":210,"color":"2","text":"Sessions 37–38 是下一积分主题的共享桥梁，在这里先回答“怎样从变化率恢复函数族”。"},
		{"id":"group-ode","type":"group","x":-100,"y":2500,"width":4850,"height":1500,"label":"G｜变化规律、解族与动态模型"},
		{"id":"ode","type":"text","x":0,"y":2620,"width":360,"height":210,"color":"4","text":"## [[常微分方程]]\n\n未知对象是函数；解必须在指定区间逐点满足方程。"},
		{"id":"general-iv","type":"text","x":500,"y":2620,"width":360,"height":210,"color":"4","text":"## [[通解与初值]]\n\n通解是一族轨迹；初值在其中选支，但不自动证明唯一。"},
		{"id":"separate","type":"text","x":1000,"y":2620,"width":360,"height":230,"color":"6","text":"## [[分离变量]]\n\n对 $y'=f(x)g(y)$，把状态与输入因子分到两侧取原函数。"},
		{"id":"lost-eq","type":"text","x":1500,"y":2620,"width":360,"height":230,"color":"1","text":"## [[分离变量漏平衡解]]\n\n除以 $g(y)$ 会删去所有满足 $g(y_*)=0$ 的常数解。"},
		{"id":"max-interval","type":"text","x":2000,"y":2620,"width":360,"height":230,"color":"4","text":"## [[微分方程最大区间]]\n\n该解无法继续延拓的区间。公式失效处要回到原方程检查，不能直接认作解的终点。"},
		{"id":"natural-exp","type":"text","x":0,"y":3120,"width":280,"height":220,"color":"3","text":"## [[自然指数函数]]\n\n$e^t$ 的导数仍是自身，使固定比例变化率可写成显式轨迹。"},
		{"id":"exp-growth","type":"text","x":400,"y":3120,"width":380,"height":220,"color":"4","text":"## [[指数增长与衰减]]\n\n非负规模满足 $y'=ry$；正初值时按 $r$ 的符号增长或衰减，零初值保持零。"},
		{"id":"logistic","type":"text","x":950,"y":3120,"width":380,"height":230,"color":"4","text":"## [[Logistic增长]]\n\n$r,K>0$ 时人均增长率随规模下降，正轨迹沿正时间方向趋向承载量。"},
		{"id":"orthogonal","type":"text","x":1500,"y":3120,"width":380,"height":230,"color":"4","text":"## [[正交轨线]]\n\n在与给定曲线族的交点，双方切线方向互相垂直。"},
		{"id":"orthogonal-solve","type":"text","x":1500,"y":3540,"width":380,"height":230,"color":"6","text":"## [[正交轨线求解]]\n\n消去族参数，在有限非零斜率区域取负倒数，再解方程并检查分支。"},
		{"id":"singular","type":"text","x":2050,"y":3120,"width":380,"height":230,"color":"1","text":"## [[方程未定义处分支独立]]\n\n方程未定义处不提供跨点延拓条件，两侧常数可独立。"},
		{"id":"ode-check","type":"text","x":2700,"y":2700,"width":1750,"height":580,"color":"2","text":"## 一条完整动态解答必须同时回答\n\n1. 方程在哪个区域有定义？\n2. 候选函数在哪个连通区间逐点代回成立？\n3. 分离时是否除掉了平衡解？\n4. 初值选择了哪条轨迹，是否真的有唯一性依据？\n5. 公式的符号与长期方向是否符合原方程？\n\n指数与 Logistic 是模型，不是看到 J 形或 S 形数据就能反推的唯一机制。"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e01","fromNode":"derivative","fromSide":"right","toNode":"linear","toSide":"left","label":"给出一阶局部项"},
		{"id":"e02","fromNode":"linear","fromSide":"right","toNode":"error","toSide":"left","label":"必须量化误差"},
		{"id":"e03","fromNode":"linear","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"quadratic","toSide":"top","label":"加入曲率"},
		{"id":"e04","fromNode":"quadratic","fromSide":"right","toNode":"taylor-poly","toSide":"left","label":"推广到 n 阶匹配"},
		{"id":"e05","fromNode":"taylor-poly","fromSide":"right","toNode":"taylor-rem","toSide":"left","label":"遗漏项需要证书"},
		{"id":"e06","fromNode":"derivative","fromSide":"right","toNode":"critical","toSide":"left","label":"零或失效给候选"},
		{"id":"e07","fromNode":"asymptote","fromSide":"right","toNode":"sketch","toSide":"left","label":"先定分支边界"},
		{"id":"e08","fromNode":"critical","fromSide":"right","toNode":"sketch","toSide":"left","label":"定位候选"},
		{"id":"e09","fromNode":"monotonic","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"sketch","toSide":"top","label":"给增减区间"},
		{"id":"e10","fromNode":"concavity","fromSide":"right","toNode":"inflection","toSide":"left","label":"变向才成拐点"},
		{"id":"e11","fromNode":"inflection","fromSide":"right","toNode":"sketch","toSide":"left","label":"补曲率转换"},
		{"id":"e12","fromNode":"critical","fromSide":"right","toNode":"first-test","toSide":"left","label":"两侧符号分类"},
		{"id":"e13","fromNode":"convex-criterion","fromSide":"right","toNode":"second-test","toSide":"left","label":"邻域斜率变化解释驻点分类"},
		{"id":"e14","fromNode":"extrema","fromSide":"right","toNode":"closed","toSide":"left","label":"全域问题"},
		{"id":"e15","fromNode":"evt","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"closed","toSide":"top","label":"保证取得"},
		{"id":"e16","fromNode":"foc","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"closed","toSide":"top","label":"内点必须列入"},
		{"id":"e17","fromNode":"first-test","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"constraint-opt","toSide":"top","label":"局部分类"},
		{"id":"e18","fromNode":"closed","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"constraint-opt","toSide":"top","label":"比较可行候选"},
		{"id":"e19","fromNode":"second-test","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"convex-global","toSide":"top","label":"局部与全局分开"},
		{"id":"e20","fromNode":"constraint-opt","fromSide":"right","toNode":"convex-global","toSide":"left","label":"曲率可作全局证书"},
		{"id":"e21","fromNode":"derivative","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"related-rates","toSide":"top","label":"同一时间参数"},
		{"id":"e22","fromNode":"linear","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"newton","toSide":"top","label":"令切线模型为零"},
		{"id":"e23","fromNode":"newton","fromSide":"right","toNode":"newton-local","toSide":"left","label":"近根时误差平方"},
		{"id":"e24","fromNode":"newton","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"newton-fail","toSide":"top","label":"公式不保全局成功"},
		{"id":"e25","fromNode":"newton-fail","fromSide":"right","toNode":"hybrid","toSide":"left","label":"括区间保底"},
		{"id":"e26","fromNode":"evt","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"rolle","toSide":"top","label":"先取得极值"},
		{"id":"e27","fromNode":"foc","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"rolle","toSide":"top","label":"内部极值斜率为零"},
		{"id":"e28","fromNode":"rolle","fromSide":"right","toNode":"mvt","toSide":"left","label":"减去割线斜率"},
		{"id":"e29","fromNode":"mvt","fromSide":"right","toNode":"increment","toSide":"left","label":"用导数界夹住未知点"},
		{"id":"e30","fromNode":"mvt","fromSide":"top","toNode":"monotonic","toSide":"bottom","label":"把局部符号推广到区间"},
		{"id":"e31","fromNode":"increment","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"ineq","toSide":"top","label":"控制差函数"},
		{"id":"e32","fromNode":"mvt","fromSide":"top","toNode":"taylor-rem","toSide":"bottom","label":"推广为余项存在式"},
		{"id":"e33","fromNode":"derivative","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"differential","toSide":"top","label":"写成线性映射"},
		{"id":"e34","fromNode":"differential","fromSide":"right","toNode":"antiderivative","toSide":"left","label":"反向恢复函数"},
		{"id":"e35","fromNode":"antiderivative","fromSide":"right","toNode":"constant","toSide":"left","label":"解族自由度"},
		{"id":"e36","fromNode":"differential","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"substitution","toSide":"top","label":"链式结构记号"},
		{"id":"e37","fromNode":"constant","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"substitution","toSide":"top","label":"得到 +C"},
		{"id":"e38","fromNode":"antiderivative","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"ode","toSide":"top","label":"由变化率恢复轨迹"},
		{"id":"e39","fromNode":"ode","fromSide":"right","toNode":"general-iv","toSide":"left","label":"区分解族与轨迹"},
		{"id":"e40","fromNode":"general-iv","fromSide":"right","toNode":"separate","toSide":"left","label":"一类可解结构"},
		{"id":"e41","fromNode":"substitution","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"separate","toSide":"top","label":"两侧取原函数"},
		{"id":"e42","fromNode":"separate","fromSide":"right","toNode":"lost-eq","toSide":"left","label":"除法会删解"},
		{"id":"e43","fromNode":"lost-eq","fromSide":"right","toNode":"max-interval","toSide":"left","label":"合并后仍查定义域"},
		{"id":"e44","fromNode":"separate","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"exp-growth","toSide":"top","label":"固定比例率"},
		{"id":"e45","fromNode":"exp-growth","fromSide":"right","toNode":"logistic","toSide":"left","label":"加入容量反馈"},
		{"id":"e46","fromNode":"separate","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"orthogonal-solve","toSide":"left","label":"斜率方程可分离时积分"},
		{"id":"e55","fromNode":"orthogonal","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"orthogonal-solve","toSide":"top","label":"把垂直条件写成斜率方程"},
		{"id":"e47","fromNode":"singular","fromSide":"top","toNode":"max-interval","toSide":"bottom","label":"限制解的连通区间"},
		{"id":"e48","fromNode":"singular","fromSide":"right","toNode":"ode-check","toSide":"left","label":"限制可声明的解"},
		{"id":"e49","fromNode":"logistic","fromSide":"right","toNode":"ode-check","toSide":"left","label":"用方向检验公式"},
		{"id":"e50","fromNode":"orthogonal-solve","fromSide":"right","toNode":"ode-check","toSide":"bottom","label":"保留隐式分支"},
		{"id":"e51","fromNode":"higher-derivative","fromSide":"top","toNode":"taylor-poly","toSide":"bottom","label":"提供逐阶系数"},
		{"id":"e52","fromNode":"natural-exp","fromSide":"right","toNode":"exp-growth","toSide":"left","label":"给出比例变化轨迹"},
		{"id":"e53","fromNode":"concavity","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"convex-criterion","toSide":"top","label":"可导时的等价判据"},
		{"id":"e54","fromNode":"convex-criterion","fromSide":"right","toNode":"sketch","toSide":"bottom","label":"建立曲率符号表"}
	]
}